/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (In this project, I analyzed historical stock price data and explored key financial indicators such as moving averages, volatility, and daily trading range. I also identified patterns in the data, including periods of high market volatility, particularly during major economic events. A forecasting model using Prophet was developed to predict future stock prices up to the year 2030. The model provided a clear visualization of trends and highlighted the uncertainty associated with long-term predictions. Overall, the project successfully achieved its objective of understanding stock price behavior and applying data analysis and forecasting techniques. This experience enhanced my skills in data preprocessing, visualization, and predictive modeling.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [0]
>>
